<title>USA: Able Telcom Holding names new CEO.</title>
<headline>Able Telcom Holding names new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Able Telcom Holding Corp said Friday it has named Gerry Hall chief executive officer to replace William Mercurio.</p>
<p>The company also said it has named Bill Ray chief financial officer.</p>
<p>No further information was immediately available.</p>
</text>
